WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,070 --> 00:00:03,550
There have been a lot of new faces here in the past few days.

2
00:00:03,550 --> 00:00:04,550
speak with a southern accent

3
00:00:04,550 --> 00:00:05,550
Going crazy while walking

4
00:00:05,550 --> 00:00:06,550
Not like those doing business

5
00:00:07,550 --> 00:00:08,550
Got it

6
00:00:08,550 --> 00:00:11,290
Thank you for taking care of yourself

7
00:00:11,290 --> 00:00:12,350
Something happened

8
00:00:13,350 --> 00:00:18,030
speak slowly

9
00:00:18,030 --> 00:00:19,030
I can't hear him coming down

10
00:00:19,030 --> 00:00:20,030
There is someone in the back hill

11
00:00:20,030 --> 00:00:21,030
We laid three wild boar snares

12
00:00:21,030 --> 00:00:23,030
They were all picked and cut off.

13
00:00:23,030 --> 00:00:24,030
Where are the footprints?

14
00:00:24,030 --> 00:00:26,180
Not a stickler from the villagers

15
00:00:26,180 --> 00:00:28,180
They are military rubber shoes with youthful inscriptions on them.

16
00:00:28,180 --> 00:00:29,180
how many people

17
00:00:29,180 --> 00:00:30,180
Seven or eight upwards

18
00:00:30,180 --> 00:00:31,180
people behind

19
00:00:31,180 --> 00:00:32,180
Fist and step on the footprints of the person in front

20
00:00:32,180 --> 00:00:33,180
One word long snake formation

21
00:00:33,180 --> 00:00:34,180
If Daqingwen hadn't been born with a human touch

22
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:35,180
We can't find it at all

23
00:00:35,180 --> 00:00:36,180
Where did it go?

24
00:00:36,180 --> 00:00:38,180
laolongkou
